# .trivyignore — Trivy CVE suppressions
# Review quarterly. Remove entries when upstream ships a fix or the compensating control changes.
#
# Entry format:
#   <CVE-ID or GHSA-ID>
#   # Why: <reason this is suppressed>
#   # Compensating control: <what mitigates the risk in this project>
#   # Unblock: <condition under which to remove this entry>
#
# Example:
# GHSA-f4xh-w4cj-qxq8
# # Why: No upstream fix available; vulnerability only affects Python 2 codepaths
# # Compensating control: Project runs Python 3.12 only; codepath is unreachable
# # Unblock: When upstream releases a patched version >= 1.2.0
